    Bug 683809 - Implement an option to only show messages that have no tags. r=rtaylor,john.bieling,tobyp

    #### How to test

    - Open quick filter bar and filter by Tags
    - Open the dropdown and choose "Untagged only"
    - The tags should disappear and only messages that are untagged should be listed

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D276332

